      <activity id="a333a1a7-aed3-5d91-aa32-fcf4b007149c" activityNameId="a4bc4edc-3a68-5e44-9821-77537fced780" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">450 kWp flat-roof installation, single-Si, on roof</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: 450 kWp flat-roof installation, single-Si, on roof
Photovoltaic installation with a capacity of 450kWp and a life time of 30 years installed in Germany. The efficiency of single-Si PV modules is 17.9% (Fraunhofer ISE Photovoltaics Report 2019). The share of rejected or replaced PV modules is estimated at 3%. The inverter is assumed to be replaced once during the service life of the PV system.;
Synonyms: monocrystalline, single crystalline, silicon; 
UUID: e70cc969-8b33-3b26-8d4e-f6a6db391cc0
All components (modules, mounting system, electric installation, inverter) for the installation of a 450 kWp photovoltaic plant, energy use for the mounting, transport of materials to the place of installation. Disposal of components after end of life.
Location: Installation in DE
Technology: Current technology for mounting of panels or laminates, electric installations and other components.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Publication of plant specific (partly aggregated) data and literature information. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e70cc969-8b33-3b26-8d4e-f6a6db391cc0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
